of July 31 and April 30, 2026, the Company held cash and cash equivalents of $<span id="xdx_90E_eus-gaap--CashAndCashEquivalentsAtCarryingValue_iI_c20260731__us-gaap--ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis__us-gaap--SalesRevenueNetMember__us-gaap--ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis__us-gaap--CreditConcentrationRiskMember_zSYile0tNiwg" title="Cash and cash equivalents"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:CashAndCashEquivalentsAtCarryingValue" contextRef="AsOf2026-07-31_us-gaap_SalesRevenueNetMember_us-gaap_CreditConcentrationRiskMember" id="Fact000682" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">11,085,200</ix:nonFraction></span> and $<span id="xdx_903_eus-gaap--CashAndCashEquivalentsAtCarryingValue_iI_c20260430__us-gaap--ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis__us-gaap--SalesRevenueNetMember__us-gaap--ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis__us-gaap--CreditConcentrationRiskMember_z9v8uXLwDbxk" title="Cash and cash equivalents"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:CashAndCashEquivalentsAtCarryingValue" contextRef="AsOf2026-04-30_us-gaap_SalesRevenueNetMember_us-gaap_CreditConcentrationRiskMember" id="Fact000684" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">12,780,208</ix:nonFraction></span>, substantially all
