the Company delivers the related services to customers, the acquired contract liabilities are reclassified to revenue. All performance
obligations related to these contract liabilities are expected to be satisfied within one year.</ix:nonNumeric></span></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

