Company&#8217;s digital assets consisted primarily of USDT, stablecoins designed to maintain a value of approximately one U.S. dollar
per token. As of July 31 and April 30, 2026, the fair value of the Company&#8217;s digital assets was $<span id="xdx_90C_eus-gaap--CryptoAssetCost_iI_c20260731_zK6IAgFkGkSd" title="Digital assets"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:CryptoAssetCost" contextRef="AsOf2026-07-31" id="Fact000798" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">229,946</ix:nonFraction></span> and $<span id="xdx_904_eus-gaap--CryptoAssetCost_iI_c20260430_zikLeSbN1s6j" title="Digital assets"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:CryptoAssetCost" contextRef="AsOf2026-04-30" id="Fact000800" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">19,245,771</ix:nonFraction></span>, respectively.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The
